# NOTE: unlike OnePlus devices, lafa does not set
# persist.vendor.nfc.config_file_name, so the NFC HAL uses its built-in default.
# The stock odm ships libnfc-hal-st-{660,685,727}_{mtp,qrd}.conf and libnfc-hal-st.conf.
